  "comment": "About 150 San Francisco Bay Area species: the 150 bird species with the most research-grade iNaturalist observations in place 54321 (the nine Bay Area counties) created up to 2026-09-27, minus the domestic Muscovy Duck, plus heard-more-than-seen forest and marsh birds (Pacific Wren, Hutton's Vireo, Varied Thrush, Western Screech Owl, Mountain Pygmy Owl, Virginia Rail, Sora, Swainson's Thrush, Brown Creeper, Golden-crowned Kinglet). `packbuilder draft --place 54321 --before 2026-09-27 --top 150 --exclude 'Cairina moschata' --add ...`. scientific_name and common_name follow the BirdNET+ label file as in us-ca-la (species the committed packs already list reuse their entries); inat_taxon_id is iNaturalist's; wikipedia_url is iNaturalist's link for the taxon. The order is the observation ranking, then the species added by hand. Drafted with `packbuilder draft` (the command is below) and read over by a person; tests/test_definition.py checks the labels.",
